  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development fails to comply with SPD guidance and would overly dominate the rear of the host dwelling. It would result in the loss of the original form of the dwelling and would therefore be contrary to the following policies which seek to ensure that developments are sympathetic to local character:Paragraph 135 of the National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (December, 2024);&nbsp;Policy D4 of The London Plan (March 2021);&nbsp;Policies SPP6, SP2, DMD1 and DMD5 of the Local Plan (September 2024); and&nbsp;LBBD Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012)",
    "The proposed development, for reasons of scale, design and siting, would result in a loss of outlook,&nbsp;loss of light and overbearing impact to neighbouring residential occupiers and would pose material harm. It&nbsp;therefore constitutes unneighbourly development which would be&nbsp;contrary to:&nbsp;National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (December, 2024);Policy D6&nbsp;of the London Plan (March 2021);The Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012); andPolicies SP2, DMD1 and DMD5 of The Barking and Dagenham Local Plan (September, 2024)"
  ],
